Subject: [PATCH v2 1/2] arm64: dts: renesas: r8a77980: add I2C support
In-Reply-To: <2a88f4e9-0a86-8e6f-0ef2-20913dc9431d@cogentembedded.com>
References: <2a88f4e9-0a86-8e6f-0ef2-20913dc9431d@cogentembedded.com>
